    {
      "id": "000000a0b0c0d014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Repository\n\n`CLAUDE.md` rules, `ROADMAP.md`, `tools/`, `docs/` (this vault)",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "000000a0b0c0d015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Skill\n\n`showreel-director/`: `SKILL.md` router, `references/`, `engine/`, `scripts/`, `evals/`. Shipped as `showreel-director.skill`.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "000000a0b0c0d016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -60,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## ShowreelKit\n\nLibrary: agent loop, tools, project model, rules. No window.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "000000a0b0c0d017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## ShowreelStudio\n\nSwiftUI executable: windows, views, theme.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "000000a0b0c0d018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Tests\n\n`swift test`, `tools/verify.sh`, `tools/check.py`.",
      "color": "6"
    }
